start: mr
R1: C1@{3ch=tr 11tr ss@top}
R2: C1@{{3ch=tr tr}@same [2tr@same]x11 ss@top}
R3: C1@{{3ch=tr tr}@same [tr 2tr@same]x11 tr ss@top}
R4: C1@{{3ch=tr tr}@same 2tr [2tr@same 2tr]x11}
R5: C2@{{3ch=tr tr}@same [ch 2tr@same htr 8dc htr 2tr@same 2sk]x3 ch 2tr@same htr 8dc htr ss@top}
R6: C2@{{3ch=tr tr}@same [{2tr 2ch 2tr}@same 14tr]x3 {2tr 2ch 2tr}@same 12tr ss@top}
